38090>>>                // If from main, this is a propbably a main file Select to Zoom.
38090>>>                Case Break
38091>>>
38091>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
38094>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down.
38094>>>                Case Break
38095>>>
